# PROGRAM 3 sanitize: feed list sanitizing and the feed boundary hook flow
#
# Hand written Brainfuck in the house style of text dot bf: comments never
# hold a command character; @cell checkpoints and tilde run lengths are
# checked by tools/bftool/lint
#
# Port of ListSanitizer sanitize and the FeedModelHooks callbacks from 1 2 1;
# the host removes; copies and assigns while every decision is made here
#
# OP 50 SANITIZE LIST: handle u32; declared Object or unknown; declared
# interface; declared accepts ArrayList; allow replacement; allow emptying;
# answers changed; result handle u32; removed u32; blocked
# OP 48 BOUNDARY BEFORE: argument count; answers 0 and reports removals
# OP 49 BOUNDARY AFTER: argument count; threw; answers 0
#
# Every if copies its subject into a temp flag t and runs the body once
# while the flag is set; an else keeps a second flag; numbers are little
# endian and compare from the high byte down
#
# Cells
#
# %cell maj 0
# %cell min 1
# %cell op 2
